  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1409.04 Processing Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1409.04 Processing Activities.\n\n(a) Except as provided in (b), below, a used oil burner shall only process used oil if they also comply with the requirements of Env-Hw 1408.\n\n(b) A used oil burner may only aggregate off-specification used oil with virgin oil or on-specification used oil for purposes of burning, and shall not aggregate such oils for purposes of producing on-specification used oil.\n\nSource. #14282, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1400.html"
